*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CRD0040
*> PURPOSE : CREDIT APPROVAL RULES
*> AUTHOR  : J.K.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-06-11 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-12-01 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 619
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CRDNIGHT STEP060
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0040.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    05 CR-SCORE           PIC 9(3).
    *> DEBT TO INCOME RATIO
    05 DTI-RATIO          PIC 9V99.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> A=APPROVE R=REFER D=DECLINE
    05 APPL-DECISION      PIC X VALUE 'D'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM CREDIT-CUTOFF
    DISPLAY "APPL-DECISION=" APPL-DECISION
    STOP RUN.
CREDIT-CUTOFF.
    *> AUTOMATIC APPROVAL
    IF CR-SCORE >= 700 AND DTI-RATIO < 0.35
        MOVE 'A' TO APPL-DECISION
    ELSE
        *> REFER TO UNDERWRITER
        IF CR-SCORE >= 620
            MOVE 'R' TO APPL-DECISION
        ELSE
            MOVE 'D' TO APPL-DECISION
        END-IF
    END-IF.
